      "value": "Thanks for creating this post! The image you posted does not take transaction fees into account.\n\nHere's a step-by-step example\n\n- Users buy 36,000 \\V for approximately 300 US$ (ignoring VAT).\n\n- The creator receives ~30,000 \\V after transaction fees.\n\n- The creator pays out ~150 US$ (30,000 * 0.005).\n\nTL;DR: Creators earn about 50%.",
